
V8’s baseline JavaScript compiler is called Sparkplug. ⚡

Simplified V8 pipeline:
JavaScript Code
      ↓
Parser
      ↓
Ignition (Interpreter)
      ↓
Sparkplug (Baseline Compiler)
      ↓
Maglev (Optimizing Compiler)
      ↓
TurboFan (Advanced Optimizing Compiler)

In short:
- Ignition → interprets JavaScript bytecode
- Sparkplug → fast baseline compilation
- Maglev → faster optimized compilation
- TurboFan → highly optimized machine code




